    {
      "text": "The cover of the report 'Patient Privacy in a Mobile World: A Framework to Address Privacy Law Issues in Mobile Health' (TrustLaw, dated June 2013), showing a close-up photograph of a patient's face with an ECG electrode attached to the forehead, and several sponsor logos along the bottom.",
